SPIN. RESET. — premium fidget spinner, glass product film (31.2 s, 1080×1920, 24 fps)
The spinner, its case and the three colourways are modelled in code from the owner's reference.png (their own product). Lines from the owner's poster.
PawanSetu logo (indigo tile, white "P") and pawansetu.in redrawn from pawansetu.in, used by the owner.

Third-party assets
- Font: Inter Tight (Rasmus Andersson et al.), SIL Open Font License 1.1 — fonts/OFL.txt — github.com/google/fonts
- 3D: three.js (MIT). Studio lighting/floor (studio.js) and post-processing from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT.
- Music and sound effects: synthesised in this project (music/score.py, mix.py). No samples, no voice.
